/*
  SignalCompareControls.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0267 · SignalCompareControls (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `SignalCompareControls` resolves (table "SignalCompareControls") lives here with its
  web `t(key, default)` English value. These entries fold into the app
  `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a
  per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without
  editing the shared catalog.

  The first blocks are the exact set of strings the web source resolves through `t()`
  (features/telemetry/components/SignalCompareControls.tsx). The web uses the English
  string itself as the default; the native port assigns the same dotted key carrying
  that exact English value, so the rendered copy is identical while staying
  translatable. The remainder backs the native state envelope (freshness chip,
  connectivity banner, loading / empty / error chrome) and the accessibility summaries.
*/

